078d4&#x27;&gt;&lt;b&gt;AGENT&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Triage&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&#x27;font-size:11px&#x27;&gt;intent · missing context · status page · directory&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#e8f2fc;strokeColor=#0078d4;fontColor=#0b3a66;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="490" y="392" width="185" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c24" value="&lt;b&gt;Retriever&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&#x27;font-size:11px&#x27;&gt;error codes as keywords + embeddings · filters&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#e8f2fc;strokeColor=#0078d4;fontColor=#0b3a66;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="695" y="392" width="185" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c25" value="&lt;span style=&#x27;font-size:9px;color:#c50f1f&#x27;&gt;&lt;b&gt;CODE&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Precedence&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&#x27;font-size:11px&#x27;&gt;SP &amp;gt; current &amp;gt; deprecated · department exceptions&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#fdecee;strokeColor=#c50f1f;fontColor=#7a0a13;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="900" y="392" width="185" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c26" value="&lt;span style=&#x27;font-size:9px;color:#0078d4&#x27;&gt;&lt;b&gt;AGENT&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Resolver&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&#x27;font-size:11px&#x27;&gt;grounded steps · citations · “not documented”&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#e8f2fc;strokeColor=#0078d4;fontColor=#0b3a66;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="900" y="530" width="185" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c27" value="&lt;span style=&#x27;font-size:9px;color:#c50f1f&#x27;&gt;&lt;b&gt;AGENT&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Verifier&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&#x27;font-size:11px&#x27;&gt;is every step backed by a cited chunk? planted text?&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#fdecee;strokeColor=#c50f1f;fontColor=#7a0a13;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="695" y="530" width="185" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c28" value="&lt;span style=&#x27;font-size:9px;color:#0078d4&#x27;&gt;&lt;b&gt;AGENT&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Escalation writer&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&#x27;font-size:11px&#x27;&gt;schema-valid ticket draft · priority by the KB&amp;#x27;s rules&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#e8f2fc;strokeColor=#0078d4;fontColor=#0b3a66;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="490" y="530" width="185" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c29" value="&lt;b&gt;Session state + the requester&amp;#x27;s ticket history (search_tickets)&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#e3f5f7;strokeColor=#00838f;fontColor=#004d55;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="490" y="645" width="595" height="52" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c30" value="&lt;b&gt;MCP client · ClientSession over stdio&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&#x27;font-size:11px&#x27;&gt;read tools → your agents   ·   create_ticket → the executor only&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#e8f2fc;strokeColor=#0078d4;fontColor=#0b3a66;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="270" y="745" width="835" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c31" value="&lt;span style=&#x27;font-size:9px;color:#c98a00&#x27;&gt;&lt;b&gt;MCP&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;helpdesk_mcp · MCP server&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&#x27;font-size:11px&#x27;&gt;lookup_employee · get_service_status · search_tickets · create_ticket